        # Quiz Application using Python

## Project Overview
This is a command-line Quiz Application built using Python.

The program:
- asks questions
- accepts user answers
- checks correctness
- calculates final score

---

## Features
- Multiple Questions
- User Input
- Score Calculation
- Answer Validation
- CLI Interface

---

## Technologies Used
- Python

---

## Concepts Learned
- Lists
- Dictionaries
- Loops
- Conditions
- User Input Handling

---

## Future Improvements
- Timer
- Difficulty Levels
- Random Questions
- GUI Version
- Database Storage